      "id": "claim_7085d10b290b4d5994f602c5d8fbc397",
      "statement": "API-04 (v2.3, base path /rtp/v2, owned by Global Payments Technology) sends and receives instant, irrevocable account-to-account payments 24x7x365 over real-time payment networks, including request-for-payment messages.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://sources/api_docs/apis/api-04-real-time-payments-api.md#L4-L17",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:78d5f97c7a0bf65d20de498f68721d0d0bbda052436e42fb773b87590a6bbdc3:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_dd1a2f34013b4c7e9123fe7240fd7c49",
      "statement": "API-04 exposes four endpoints: POST /credit-transfers, POST /requests-for-payment, GET /credit-transfers/{id} (status accepted, rejected or pending-review), and GET /participants/{routing} for receiving-bank reachability.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://sources/api_docs/apis/api-04-real-time-payments-api.md#L19-L26",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:5688e375a4d4fe3433c667a154e1a7b9dff2ca3cc00a9f7e16d2ae537244a1c2:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_3445223cfdcd4b559942cca605a10636",
      "statement": "API-04 uses OAuth scopes rtp:send, rtp:read and rtp.rfp:write, is limited to 600 requests/minute per client and $1,000,000 per payment, and has an SLO of 99.99% availability with p95 end-to-end 4 s; data is classified Restricted - Financial Transaction.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://sources/api_docs/apis/api-04-real-time-payments-api.md#L11-L17",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:fc31f5698d80f6f409e859e80696e93bde2d2dd12671f2bfcbccb4b5dcce88aa:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_dd8da8839adf4587b3bde9b6e71b3492",
      "statement": "The example credit transfer request sends an Idempotency-Key header and a body with debtorAccount, creditorRouting, masked creditorAccount, amount and purpose; the example 200 response returns id, status accepted and settledAt synchronously.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://sources/api_docs/apis/api-04-real-time-payments-api.md#L28-L58",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:cf009de9487144f974251692236b813ffb3e254902cc8791ff6a6aa24b7b1d4b:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_3cfb825679564a39be299969beb40ea7",
      "statement": "API-04's upstream sources are the Accounts API (API-01), Fraud Risk Signals API (API-08) and Customer Identity & KYC API (API-07); its downstream consumers are the real-time payment network, Webhooks & Event Notifications API (API-18) and Treasury Liquidity Positions API (API-15) for intraday cash.",
      "evidence": [
